    <briefdescription>
<para>There are three possible scenarios getting to a property represented by this expression: </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>1) the property is on a singleton parent (module, package or singleton class) (left must be null) 2) the property is on an instance parent (left must be null) 3) the property is on this (left must be null) 4) the property is on &quot;left&quot; (left must be not null) </para>
    </detaileddescription>
